``too-many-branches`` now counts ``async for`` loops.
``method-cache-max-size-none``, ``singledispatch-method`` and
``singledispatchmethod-function`` now check ``async def``. ``bad-dunder-name``
now checks ``async def`` methods. ``looping-through-iterator`` now checks
``async for``, so an async generator consumed again in a nested loop is
reported.

Refs #11722
